{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年52歲的1997年香港小姐冠軍翁嘉穗（Virginia），自1999年嫁給年長20載的海馬牌床褥創辦人兼七海化工集團主席鄔友正後，便淡出娛樂圈，專心相夫教子，過著令人羨慕的豪門少奶奶生活。翁嘉穗活躍於社交平台，不時分享奢華日常與保養得宜的凍齡美貌。日前她出席M+慈善晚宴，高貴性感打扮成全場焦點！</p><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗密密更新社交平台。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260311/1108437470950854656641305.png/TaQlOVzV95muMLzXF4edVTepQHsjj0k3myrr_Zsq6_0\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗密密更新社交平台。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗愛分享美照。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260311/1108437468488667136204751.jpeg/SDe5cd9qimPT-RAnfqp1eMkaGB5rSPI75wXGSucFxko\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗愛分享美照。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><p>翁嘉穗低胸晚裝出席M+慈善晚宴</p><p>翁嘉穗日前出席M+慈善晚宴，她發文稱讚M+慈善晚宴為「本年度最令人期待的盛會之一」，能夠與多位藝術家、收藏家同場交流，感到無比榮幸與感激。翁嘉穗以一身低胸黑色晚裝出席晚宴，上身是金色閃片內搭，下身則是長長的黑色裙，翁嘉穗晚裝打扮性感又不失大方得體，52歲保養有道，絕對是全場焦點。</p><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗以一身低胸黑色晚裝出席M＋慈善晚宴。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012332049960960194352.png/z8V472LszycyOC7lIUd2nioR8OBHDt5fknzNBJJ8zQQ\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗以一身低胸黑色晚裝出席M＋慈善晚宴。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗打扮高貴性感。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012329638105088041723.png/R1wZS4XJ9ijlWPHj8E_gzZwtnlTM5febna8M_J2vDPw\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗打扮高貴性感。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗打扮高貴性感。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012327222054912530617.png/WQ9HP9J11hnMqEn7nBidU15wZ730eyFAgVYk64FWJOs\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗打扮高貴性感。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗是全場焦點。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012324592095232348960.png/yBNLYMFIfMAX8aVm_IZYHeuBd_6yNYDhNHQHGTR0Bxk\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗是全場焦點。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗是全場焦點。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012335795605504798210.png/APY4VW2RlHgEnERM-JTsBKFzp7oMoT1r9GBxzPRgccw\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗是全場焦點。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗與出席賓客打卡。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012333379555328430892.png/4N-kl8nyrrURPfC_eTEps8oNDAiSwpCXYzF_72Mxf-8\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗與出席賓客打卡。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗與出席賓客打卡。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012331118694400591736.png/yBiBinDeR3GA9OwxhHUYShwM7IwAjsOG5lyv9eZcr_U\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗與出席賓客打卡。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗拍下美照。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012328367099904295368.png/g4CfBbTKHdkLDFsI53j5xJCWonxbrzKVDnvWog571qI\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗拍下美照。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"翁嘉穗發文。（IG@kashuivirginia）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261102/1194012326299176960071892.png/ycedK6tMynyzFaxfBlrprOctAcmCBAUw66IxkOuiMZA\"/><figcaption>翁嘉穗發文。（IG@kashuivirginia）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T01:22:15.392097+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":643,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T01:00:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T02:39:27.783928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T01:19:02.793057+00:00","content_hash":"f7b57c648d672e866574e5fd43076ecc6eff983e988215bcb04638719f5266f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}